== Notes ==

* Like most spells with a harmful area of effect, this spell uses the [[area of effect#Targeting|standard hostile]] targeting scheme, meaning it can affect [[party]] members, depending on the [[PvP setting|PvP]] and [[difficulty setting]]s.
* If the duration is at least 4 rounds, then it is reduced for [[player character]]s to a half when the [[difficulty setting]] is "normal", and to a quarter at easier settings. This is cumulative for each PC affected ''(a bug)''.
* While this spell can be cast with [[extend spell]], the duration will not be doubled due to a bug in the script.
** A fix for both bugs is available on the Vault<sup>[http://nwvault.ign.com/View.php?view=Scripts.Detail&id=3739]</sup>
* Due to a .2da bug, ''clarity'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

